sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend Socket.IO
    participant GW as EventsGateway
    participant AUTH as JwtAuthGuard
    participant BE as Backend Services
    participant REDIS as Redis

    FE->>GW: connect(auth:{token})
    GW->>AUTH: Verifica JWT
    AUTH-->>GW: user + companyId
    GW->>GW: socket.join("company:{companyId}")
    GW->>GW: socket.join("user:{userId}")
    GW-->>FE: connected

    Note over FE,REDIS: Emitir a empresa
    BE->>GW: emitToCompany(companyId, event, data)
    GW->>GW: io.to("company:X").emit(event, data)
    GW-->>FE: event + data

    Note over FE,REDIS: Emitir a usuario
    BE->>GW: emitToUser(userId, event, data)
    GW->>GW: io.to("user:X").emit(event, data)
    GW-->>FE: event + data

    Note over FE,REDIS: Eventos del sistema
    BE->>GW: notification:new
    BE->>GW: document:ready
    BE->>GW: stock:alert
    BE->>GW: debt:alert
    BE->>GW: company:blocked
